{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/u7zvnQynXYPbFqWH28GsVg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:33.484985+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/u7zvnQynXYPbFqWH28GsVg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>上海交通大学Bio-X研究院</span></p></section><section><section><p><font><span>优秀大学生学术交流夏令营</span></font><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>欢迎感兴趣的学子报名参加</span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/icoOywuc11kJBSTbTGZpNyZxJfo1p5Pq810ia3mpwYahHaXmUtf1pOhy2ichozajibL53iafT1iaHzQFAnqMthCkRw25kflNVbB2wJGKo0B5Sicg4E/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>解码生命 快乐科学</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>上海交通大学Bio-</span><span>X</span><span>研究院</span>是</span><span>继斯坦福(Stanford)大学后的世界第二个、中国第一个Bio-X研究院。Bio-X</span><span>由贺林院士领衔，是交大生命科学与多学科交叉的前沿阵地。历经二十余年，</span><span>研究院</span><span>已形成了一个开放严谨、笃行创新的研究体系，</span><span>为国家创造和囤积了丰厚的“脑力”资源。今天的研究院正集中精力面向人民生命健康的国家重大需求努力工作。</span><span>为了让全国优秀大学生进一步了解我院，将于2026年7月6-8日举办优秀大学生</span><span>学术交流夏令营</span><span>。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/icoOywuc11kIn77uupuSAQUWchhOPsCPV2Iqte3y0IBk90ZmBib6VtXnu0NfohqFCvUJ3O5ycJys4WSjgpVrRjXRtDt7DicUUsYGjy24RJwvGk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icoOywuc11kKjjqBOuicagRudOyqiawglO5yuVBgiaD3txFuJmwLaK1FlfLM5ibyBC9zX9zH77iaCW2nHKCvBjUAicFU2hTYufgE9OtjImH3S8dF24/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icoOywuc11kJrH03R0gtgFg5GiaDicpscL54p9RZ3mWw4RryPMFHRb5f9JMm1tibx1mvp3eWpI95IHUzkeFWQOHt08Q2CIqnarrM0KowHprUJwU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请资格</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>全国各高等学校2027年应届本科毕业生；</span></p></li><li><p><span>学业成绩和英语水平优秀（CET6≥425或TOEFL≥90或IELTS≥6.0）；</span></p></li><li><p><span>对生命科学有浓厚的兴趣，有志于从事学术研究工作，有突出的科研表现或潜在的科研能力。</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icoOywuc11kKLT0CicDPibTfBuyvHQVG2CRYficsnCTgtKYNoPlPibpEMZtR4oc5DRQCQ0THXwJX6OEPicib3wFeY0XybkHFakeWdvx7ydLuVN4ibq0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动介绍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>上海交通大学Bio-X研究院（以下简称“研究院”）是于2005年由NHGG（Neuropsychiatric and Human Genetics Group，神经精神与人类遗传学研究室）和2000年成立的Bio-X生命科学研究中心经过重组凝练而成。自从谢绳武校长亲自宣布了“研究院”的成立起，标志了我校正式启动了生命学科与其他多学科间进行交叉合作研究基地的建设，开始起到成为从事与生命科学相关的多学科交叉研究科学家的工作平台的作用，并为不同学科和领域的研究人员和学生提供一个学术思想和信息交流的温馨的“家”。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>研究院现任院长为师咏勇教授，名誉院长为贺林院士。研究院目前由具有不同学术背景的国内外资深研究者和特聘教授领导的“核心”和“卫星”研究室，以及一批优秀、富有创造性的年轻学者、讲究实效的技术支撑人员、认真严格的行政管理人员，一群年轻聪明的研究生和博士后组成。近年来，荣获“教育部长江学者奖励计划”创新团队，国家自然科学基金创新群体，教育部重点实验室正式挂牌，荣获上海交通大学先进实验室以及“SJTU-BioX合成基因机器创新科技工作室”。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>此次暑期交流营计划招收营员约30人，</span><span>通过安排不同课题组的实验室介绍，让学生了解生物学不同领域的知识和发展趋势，近距离了解未来的专业学习方向，增强学生对生物学的兴趣，给学生提供了解生物学研究最新进展的机会。</span><span>具体研究方向请参阅各课题组信息：bio-x.sjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/icoOywuc11kIqkjOicRKs0XO4xQ8gAggHtg4jcKMsy8EjsVgX2ByVXgHIz0hOYCEEZADlFgnxPWlBNvoFp9I7eLU1ne6ETq0PV8UHnSffSLXc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/icoOywuc11kJPsqpcrF6YhHNKsGrZqFfjAicaWAETjxvoebGkVzkn4Ed9swknZz65oSXWh99B33HMqU2Giap30rYdUfsoibMLBIsrjAxvWFGmp0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icoOywuc11kIN3iaB9Ql2hiaQoQvwM4NpBjSYh5CZOMn4Jeq9RqOcBWuG9xlFf4QeQclMDpL1F4Rs7DNPF2YtCGTYTmEbCLWTCibVIL9ibglGLM0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人请在</span><span>https://ga.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgl/xlygl/default.aspx</span><span>完成在线报名，过期报名无效。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>报名截止时间</span><span><span>2026年7月5日中午12点，</span>我院将根据申请者材料，以申请者的教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、综合素质等为主要评价依据，由专家对申请者进行入围资格审查。我院会以电子邮件或电话的形式分批次通知入围者。同时，学术交流夏令营入围名单将会在网站公示。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>提交材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><ol><li><p><span>个人简历</span></p></li><li><p><span>本科成绩单（教务部门盖章）</span></p></li><li><p><span>本科成绩排名证明（教务部门盖章）</span></p></li><li><p><span>英语成绩证明</span></p></li><li><p><span>学籍认证报告</span><span>（申请人登录高等教育学生信息咨询网www.chsi.com.cn，进入“学籍查询--学信档案”在线申请学籍验证，打印下载本人的学籍认证报告。）</span></p></li><li><p><span>有关获奖证书和学术科研成果证明材料</span><span>，以及专家推荐材料等（非必须）</span></p></li></ol><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>内容安排</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span>实验室介绍、与感兴趣的课题组交流、师生座谈等。</span><span>（具体安排将后续通知各位营员）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询联系</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span>邓老师：</span><span><span>021-34207976</span></span></p><p><span>邮箱：dengmengqiao@sjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><em><span>WELCOME</span></em></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/2f0d2facc3eb2c7ab202.jpg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>图文</span></strong><span>丨Bio-X研究院</span><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>编审</span></strong><span>丨Bio-X研究院</span></p></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"2c74558a3fbb009c60ce7e2b546cfa11845387b4d476197d00582295f5ad6c63","textLength":1442,"sourceSha256":"ec84f3daa542702cb4670f1d0bf419e9d08146839329b3a2cd815bf42bba5efe","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-1ca8174e0c1179d14cc7","title":"2026年上海交通大学Bio-X研究院优秀大学生学术交流夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:33.484985+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/N60VDknP8lGibGbn5iaWCvesZMuNMUPnd1Heia4zpPfU63W2tYd49Yz4SdH5ZKHF5XYhNGpPvD7uiccuQtibZxQNWdg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg","file":"assets/articles/media/2f0d2facc3eb2c7ab202.jpg"}]}
